From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 14:30:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: gs101-raven: enable the thermal
 sensors

Under sustained load with no thermal zones, the phone reset. With the
sensors enabled, the CPU clusters throttle from 85 C.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Signed-off-by: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
index 5bfe8d9fb..6a635c30b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-raven.dts
@@ -76,6 +76,10 @@ bluetooth {
 	};
 };
 
+&acpm_tmu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 /* Unused blocks the bootloader leaves powered: genpd turns them off */
 &pd_g2d {
 	status = "okay";
